OL,3,GNEWSASchool closure extended over water
OL,4,Aissue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school forced to close
OL,7,Fbecause of water supply problems will
OL,8,Fremain shut on Monday after staff said
OL,9,Fthe issue was unlikely to be resolved
OL,10,Fover the weekend.
OL,12,FAbout 420 pupils at Slade Primary
OL,13,FSchool in Tonbridge were sent home at
OL,14,Fmidday on 10 September because it was
OL,15,Funable to operate "without a safe and
OL,16,Freliable service".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
