OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASchool closure extended over water
OL,4,Aissue
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a message to parents on Friday,
OL,7,Fheadteacher Viki Garrett apologised for
OL,8,Fthe "significant impact and
OL,9,Finconvenience" and said the lack of
OL,10,Frepair timescales had left the school
OL,11,Fin "an extremely difficult position
OL,12,Fwhen planning for next week".
OL,14,FSouth East Water (SEW) said: "We remain
OL,15,Fin close contact with the school to
OL,16,Fresolve this issue as soon as
OL,17,Fpossible."
